  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMUNITIES OF HOPE: INTRA AND INTERFAITH HARMONY FOR SUSTAINABLE PEACE  2021-22</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strive to improve relations among different faith communities by strengthening community-based structures that will facilitate local communities to prevent and addresses religiously motivated conflicts. The project will also mobilize civil society organization (CSOs) to advocate attitudinal change for effective implementation of laws and policies towards equal citizenship in 2 districts of Punjab (Lahore and Gujranwala) province and Islamabad Capital Territory</narrative>
  </description>
